{"id": "abbc937a8044474930e8fc901f9da3bd", "text": "a step further and informs Arjuna that he would wage the war even if he \nwere  not inclined to do so, as that was His will. Sri Vadiraja Teertha in \nBGL  provides another interpretation for the word \u2018 ava\u015ba \u2019 in 18.60 . This  \nword also means \u2018one who is  under the control of the Lord\u2019 (as \u2018 a\u2019 means \nLord and \u2018 va\u015ba\u2019 means \u2018under the c ontrol\u2019). In this case, the context is that \nArjuna will end up waging the war under the control of the Lord Almighty  \nas that was His will.", "embedding": [-0.11050279438495636, 0.08446893841028214, -0.050047632306814194, 0.04179786518216133, -0.09805966168642044, -0.006960171740502119, 0.06316281855106354, -0.00821046531200409, 0.07401891052722931, 0.05944638326764107, -0.016500812023878098, 0.004076704848557711, -0.046629589051008224, -0.07481282949447632, -0.010182738304138184, -0.002595549914985895, -0.04398830980062485, 0.0039076898247003555, -0.050558533519506454, -0.033948469907045364, 0.03064141236245632, 0.05084837228059769, 0.022249948233366013, -0.022911423817276955, -0.007432070095092058, -0.006716032978147268, -0.03881993144750595, -0.048644691705703735, -0.006674250587821007, 0.03929644823074341, 0.011670033447444439, -0.06801731139421463, -0.014928136020898819, 0.03685064986348152, -0.06304574757814407, 0.0652645081281662, -0.07314735651016235, 0.03752366453409195, -0.06158122792840004, -0.12642239034175873, 0.06799125671386719, 0.06405743956565857, -0.04906955361366272, -0.01887601427733898, 0.004375947639346123, -0.0034866095520555973, -0.08798748254776001, -0.023900259286165237, 0.03574993461370468, 0.03810702636837959, 0.03342090919613838, -0.07046594470739365, -0.03608056157827377, -0.008314387872815132, 0.005849054548889399, -0.04833840951323509, 0.0022143542300909758, -0.05944235622882843, 0.10603652149438858, 0.022293342277407646, -0.07246624678373337, 0.02999776415526867, 0.04086475819349289,